WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:07.260
Hey, it's Shay Sellers from Happy Global.

2
00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:10.160
I'm standing here in front of our
corporate headquarters in Dallas, Texas.

3
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:12.860
We have offices all over the world,
but we're proud to say that we chose

4
00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.940
Dallas, Texas as our
corporate headquarters.

5
00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.920
So, why Dallas?

6
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.260
There's not just one
reason to choose Dallas.

7
00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:20.340
There's several.

8
00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:23.400
DFW area's economy is robust.

9
00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:26.600
DFW has the fifth largest GDP in America,

10
00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:28.600
22 million annual visitors,

11
00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.180
the third fastest growing
American metro area,

12
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.660
and is home to 48
Fortune 1000 company HQs,

13
00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:38.820
and was ranked the number one place
for company headquarter relocation.

14
00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:42.590
The Dallas area was recently ranked
the top market for real estate

15
00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:45.490
development by PwC.

16
00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:48.370
In fact, two suburbs of
DFW, McKinney and Frisco,

17
00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:52.070
were crowned the first and second
best real estate markets in America.

18
00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:56.290
These cities are also ranked in the
top 10 safest cities in the U.S.

19
00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:01.750
Some of the best school districts
in Texas are also located in DFW.

20
00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:06.320
These include Frisco, Southlake, Lovejoy,
and Plano Independent School Districts.

21
00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:09.450
There are also great private
schools like St. Mark's for Boys

22
00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:11.030
and the Hockaday School for Girls,

23
00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:13.710
which are two of the best
private schools in the state.

24
00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:17.490
Another reason to choose
Dallas is the arts and culture.

25
00:01:17.690 --> 00:01:20.010
The Dallas Arts District
is the largest in the U.S.

26
00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:21.790
and has been ranked
the number one arts district

27
00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:23.990
in the U.S. for two consecutive years.

28
00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:26.170
There are dozens of museums in Dallas,

29
00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:28.250
including the Perot Museum
of Natural History,

30
00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:29.570
the Dallas Museum of Modern Art,

31
00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:32.530
and the Crow Museum of Asian Art,
just to name a few.

32
00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:35.290
There's also the award-winning
Clyde Warren Park,

33
00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:36.850
the Dallas World Aquarium,

34
00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:38.550
the Dallas Symphony Orchestra,

35
00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:40.270
and the Dallas Children's Theater.

36
00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:43.930
If you like sports, Dallas
is a great city to be in.

37
00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:46.210
Dallas is home to five professional teams,

38
00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:48.570
like the Dallas Mavericks,
the Texas Rangers,

39
00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:51.610
and the world's most valuable
sports team, the Dallas Cowboys.

40
00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:54.650
The DFW area is full of
things to do and experience,

41
00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:55.550
but what about food?

42
00:01:55.570 --> 00:01:58.730
From restaurants, especially supermarkets,

43
00:01:58.750 --> 00:01:59.890
Dallas has got you covered.

44
00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:03.850
There's every kind of
restaurant in Dallas,

45
00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:07.430
including Chinese, Korean,
Mexican, Japanese,

46
00:02:07.490 --> 00:02:09.830
Texas barbecue, and so much more.

47
00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:12.990
Dallas is also home to some of the
best universities in the world,

48
00:02:13.010 --> 00:02:16.270
like SMU, TCU, UT Dallas, and UNT.

49
00:02:16.370 --> 00:02:19.070
We chose Dallas because it's
one of the fastest-growing,

50
00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:22.450
economically robust, culturally diverse,
and happiest places to work.

51
00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:25.070
So, come join Happy Global
and see for yourself.
